THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS

This product does not yet bundle any third-party component: the repository holds
documents only. The stack it is built to — Tauri, React, Vite, TypeScript,
Tailwind CSS, TanStack Query, rusqlite / SQLite, serde — enters this list as each
component is adopted, after the dependency audit that slice F0 puts in place, and
the authoritative list is the one generated from the dependency manifests
(Cargo.toml, package.json). Full licence texts are retained in the lockfiles and
reproduced in the distributed package.
